  OWASP dependency-check suppressions.

  Rules for this file:
    * Every suppression states WHY, and carries an expiry via <until> where the underlying
      issue is expected to be fixed upstream. A permanent suppression needs a permanent reason.
    * Suppress a specific CVE against a specific coordinate. Never suppress by broad regex.
    * A false positive is a reason. "Noisy" is not.

