  (poi-ooxml 5.2.5 / CVE-2025-31672, logback 1.4.14 / CVE-2024-12798 + CVE-2024-12801) should
  be FIXED by upgrading, not suppressed. They are tracked as SUP-002 in docs/audit/FINDINGS.md.
-->
